{
"markdown": "### VivoStyle\n\nBrings the \"Flip Card\" lock screen wallpaper effect of vivo phones to iOS devices.\nJust tilt your phone left/right and the photos on your lock screen switch back and forth using the gyroscope sensor.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/VivoStyle/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/VivoStyle/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **3D photo flip:** Choose as many photos as you like. Swipe through photos continuously as you tilt the device.\n- **Video wallpaper:** Supports using a looping (muted) video as the wallpaper.\n- **Physics customization:** Adjust tilt sensitivity, depth (parallax) and motion smoothness.\n- **4 transition effects:** Cross-fade, Lenticular, Frosted Glass and Depth.\n- **Frame:** Choose between enlarging the photo to fill the screen or keeping the original (with a blurred border).",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
